WEBVTT

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.380
Prince Geordo!

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.350
What is it?

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.870
Th-There's trouble!

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.290
Crawling along the ground suits you!

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.000
<i>Why the heck is this happening?!</i>

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.750
<b>Doom</b>

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:48.560
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:48.560
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:56.470
<b>Episode 2:
I Turned Into a Villainess...</b>

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.710
An actor's been injured?

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:01.520
I heard it's just a sprain, 
but I doubt they can stand on the stage.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.350
This isn't good. It's almost time 
for the play to start...

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.910
What kind of role is it?

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:10.300
A wicked older stepsister 
who bullies the protagonist.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.310
It's a very important role.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.150
We'll have to use a stand-in.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.750
Um, wouldn't Lady Catarina 
be the best choice?

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:26.620
Huh?!

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:29.660
Frey, what on earth are you saying?

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.080
I agree with her.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.420
Now you're in on the joke, Ginger?

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:38.300
Actually, I also think there's no one better 
than Lady Catarina for the part.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.530
Yes, yes!

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.310
If Lady Catarina does it, 
I know it'll turn out just fine!

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.840
No way! I can't!

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.610
I can't do human roles!

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:48.140
Besides, I'm not even 
on the student council!

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:49.850
That's all right.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.900
As long as it's you, 
the other members won't mind.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.560
Please, Lady Catarina!

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:11.850
<i>Maybe Geordo will tell them I can't do it!</i>

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:19.080
The character doesn't have 
that many lines. You'll be fine.

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.710
Let's do our best!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.200
Let's bring excitement 
to the school festival together.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.570
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:52.040
We just disbanded days ago!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.270
Yes, successfully we 
avoided all the doom flags,

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:57.510
and we intended 
to enjoy the rest of our life.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:01.640
That black-hearted prince 
sweet-talked her right into it!

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:05.760
Try not to confuse her with someone 
competent who can do anything.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.720
There's no way Catarina can act.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.370
<i>This play is written and directed by Sophia.</i>

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.800
<i>I know she worked hard on it every day,</i>

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:23.430
<i>saying she wanted to create 
the romance of the century.</i>

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.870
<i>That's right. I shouldn't 
be stressing out over this.</i>

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.660
<i>I have to do this for Sophia!</i>

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.150
<i>It's no use! I can't memorize all this!</i>

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.760
<i>My only choice now is...</i>

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:42.130
<i>to make cue cards 
as a little added insurance!</i>

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:46.490
<i>The story's based on a fairy tale 
that everyone in this world knows.</i>

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:50.510
<i>It's somewhat similar to the </i>Cinderella<i> 
story from my previous life.</i>

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.440
Sob, sob...

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.640
<i>A noble's daughter, Marianne,</i>

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:02.640
Nag, nag!

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:06.740
<i>is worked like a servant by her 
stepmother and stepsister.</i>

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.030
Gripe, gripe!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:10.640
<i>Marianne is always kind and cheerful.</i>

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.200
<i>She's very popular with the villagers, 
always sharing vegetables with them.</i>

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:11.860
Here!

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.210
Yay!

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:18.640
<i>One day, they learn that a ball 
is to be held at the castle.</i>

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:15.980
Prod, prod!

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.600
Panic, panic!

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:21.890
<i>The stepmother and stepsister 
leave dressed in their best,</i>

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.810
<i>but Marianne has to stay at home alone.</i>

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:28.190
<i>Then the villagers present her 
with a dress they made.</i>

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.590
Here!

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:30.680
<i>"Wear this to the ball," they say.</i>

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.120
Wow!

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.160
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.640
<i>Unlike Cinderella, 
there's no magic in this story.</i>

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:40.200
<i>But the villagers forgot 
to bring shoes for her.</i>

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.320
<i>The best thing she has right now</i>

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.300
<i>is a pair of boots she wears in the fields!</i>

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:47.120
<i>But Marianne smiles brightly.</i>

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:50.390
<i>"It's all right. They'll 
be hidden under the dress!"</i>

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.720
<i>Her smile and unique way of thinking</i>

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.570
<i>are what make Marianne so charming.</i>

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:58.120
<i>So she has boots instead of glass slippers?</i>

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.750
<i>That's interesting.</i>

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.250
Sister, what are you doing?

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:06.620
M-Memorizing my lines, of course!

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:11.230
This script is interesting. 
I can really see Sophia's style in it.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:15.760
Yes, Sophia's tastes are particularly 
visible in the protagonist.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.560
Lady Catarina, are you doing all right?

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.890
Yes. How about you?

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.830
Having the lead role isn't easy.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.610
I've had plenty of time 
to learn it in rehearsals.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.820
Now it's just a matter of doing it.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.610
You're always so dependable, you know that?

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:31.820
Not at all.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:36.340
I'm just so happy I get to 
stand on the stage with you.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:41.160
Even just being able to borrow 
the boots you've used so lovingly...

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:44.630
Oh, please. I'm just 
sorry they're my old ones.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.260
Lady Catarina!

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:50.460
If anything happens, I'll do 
everything I can to back you up!

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:51.340
Don't worry!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.830
Thanks! I'll be counting on you!

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:04.380
I'm told Master Keith 
will be playing a villager.

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.280
Yes, I look forward to seeing it.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:09.770
And Catarina's working 
behind the scenes? Too bad.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.560
Please, don't joke!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:15.660
If she was in the play, 
she would find a way to ruin it for sure!

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:25.080
Sophia, just do what you always do.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.550
Brother...

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:28.410
Okay.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:42.190
Catarina, you're wearing 
that costume in front of everyone?

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:44.820
Yes... Is something wrong with that?

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:50.650
We don't want you to catch a chill.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.520
Thank you!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.660
It's time to start.

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:59.630
<i>Oh, crap... I'm suddenly feeling nervous!</i>

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.000
Sister.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.500
Here.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.560
You're hungry, right?

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.840
Thanks!

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.540
Yum!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:13.690
Okay.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:34.260
<i>They've all rehearsed a lot 
to prepare for this day.</i>

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:37.740
<i>I have to make sure 
I don't screw it up for them.</i>

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:59.510
The castle looks so beautiful, as always.

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:02.970
I hope I get to go there someday.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.770
Marianne! Working hard as usual, I see!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.660
You came at just the right time.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.200
Here's today's share.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.270
Enjoy them with everyone.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.830
Th-Thank you for always sharing!

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:22.350
Lady Catarina, let's go.

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:23.280
So very busy...

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:23.280
Right.

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:41.680
<i>Crap! I forgot all the lines!</i>

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:43.080
Catarina?!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.310
Oh! It really is Catarina!

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.760
What's going on?

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:51.760
Marianne! I still see dust here!

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.400
You're simply useless!

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.980
Katarina, say something to her!

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:58.440
<i>I have the next line!</i>

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.260
<i>Uh...</i>

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.870
<i>It's gone! Where is it? Where'd it go?!</i>

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.050
<i>Oh, no! It's way over there!</i>

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.750
Lady Catarina?

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:29.700
Come, let's forget about Marianne

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:33.560
and practice dancing 
to prepare for the ball!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.100
You need that paper, right?

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.110
Let's dance our way over to it.

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:40.240
Mary!

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.470
Huh?

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:46.470
<i>There's no scene like that in the script.</i>

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:49.000
<i>Whatever. We'll change it to a waltz.</i>

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.240
Prince Alan!

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:54.250
The cue card! Get the cue card!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:57.020
<i>Huh? What does that mean?</i>

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.020
<i>Cue...?</i>

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.890
<i>Oh! She's saying it's my cue 
to knock 'em dead!</i>

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.270
<i>I've got this!</i>

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:07.480
<i>It's no use!</i>

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.940
<i>People here wouldn't 
know what a "cue card" is!</i>

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:13.230
<i>Prince Alan, you are unbelievably dense!</i>

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.270
<i>In that case...</i>

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:16.490
Mary!

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:17.450
Right!

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:36.210
Lady Catarina, it's almost time 
for me to leave the stage!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.430
No way!

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.470
Lady Sophia and I will give you directions!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.340
Just do your best to get through this scene!

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:45.800
Now, I must go find a dress 
to wear to the ball.

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:52.150
Dear Sister, may I go to the ball with you?

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:57.100
<i>I think this is the scene where 
the stepsister teases Marianne.</i>

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.430
Lady Catarina?

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:02.900
<i>What do I do?!</i>

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:07.280
We should run away right now!

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.240
No, we should apologize 
and then leave the stage.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:12.330
There must be some way out of this!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.870
We avoided all those doom flags, didn't we?!

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:18.510
Too bad these aren't 
the villainess Catarina's lines.

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:20.630
She knows all of those by heart!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:23.850
But that doesn't do us any good...

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.320
Wait! Villainess?!

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:32.250
So that's what happened.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.980
I understand.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.870
Let's call a brief intermission.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.340
We're in the middle of a scene.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:39.380
We have no choice. Lower the curtain!

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.030
You really ought to learn your place!

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:51.840
You thought you could go 
to the ball all covered in mud?

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:54.280
Don't make me laugh!

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.950
<i>She's ad-libbing!</i>

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:59.820
Dear Sister, are you 
saying I can't go the ba—

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:06.270
I guess you'd have to be reborn 
a million times to understand.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.600
The only ones...

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.470
suitable for the ball...

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:12.730
are perfect ladies such as myself!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:17.190
Crawling along the ground suits you!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.430
Lady Catarina, that was fantastic!

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.830
You were the perfect wicked stepsister!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:38.460
Your acting was so realistic, 
I almost forgot it was just a play.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:43.140
But I couldn't say the lines that Sophia 
worked so hard to come up with.

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:44.300
I'm sorry.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.600
No, no!

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:50.580
You added a dynamic touch 
that breathed new life into this story!

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:54.020
It was tremendously inspiring. Thank you!

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.260
You gave me a great idea!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:14:01.480
Let's make this story even 
more exciting and thrilling!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.960
What do you mean?

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:05.350
We'll add a new character!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:05.940
Huh?!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:08.360
A new character?

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:12.940
I've added a romance 
subplot between Lady Catarina

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.370
and a knight in a black mask!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.880
What?!

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.300
My sister in... a romance?

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:19.260
For real?

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:25.210
This scene will bring more excitement 
to both the story and the audience.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:26.700
I see.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:28.220
Then, I'll play the knight—

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:32.100
There isn't enough time to change 
the villager boy into a knight costume.

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.810
Then, I'll do it. I'm good at memorization.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.560
You're playing the music, Prince Alan.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.680
I'll be the lovely actress 
who plays a male part!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.640
And who would play the stepmother, then?

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:43.770
What about if the prince 
was actually the black knight?

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.980
Inconceivable.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.110
On that note, Brother,

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:52.620
would you play the knight in the black mask?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.170
Your face will be covered,

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.940
and I just happen 
to have the perfect costume.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:03.660
All right.

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.340
Oh, good!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.400
All right, we're raising the curtain.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.890
Places, everyone!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.170
I'll pick you up at 7 o'clock.

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:19.980
Make sure you come back.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.310
I will.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.770
You have such clear eyes.

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:48.330
What's your name?

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:52.410
I'm only a princess for one night...

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.240
The phantom thief, Black Mask, has arrived.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.160
I'll be taking the treasure.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:19.330
Black Mask takes Katarina hostage 
in a plot to steal the castle's riches.

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.290
Let go of her!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.760
As the prince confronts Black Mask,

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.920
Marianne tries her hardest to save Katarina.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.780
But tragically, the bell tolls seven...

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:34.410
Lady Sophia, something isn't right.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.430
Huh?

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:41.720
You're too close to her! Step away!

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:56.160
Don't think you'll get away 
with this because it's just an act.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.620
It's not like you to get 
so heated over a mere play.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:14.270
Huh?!

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.790
Shouldn't we stop them?

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.860
Actually, this is perfect!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.250
I'd like them to make it even more exciting!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.020
Oh, dear!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.150
I've gotten lost!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:28.400
Keith?!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:31.580
Where am I?

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.460
Is it this way?

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.770
No, that way?

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.290
Who are you?!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:38.320
Come on!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.700
Was there any need 
for you to come out here, too?!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.940
I'm a simple villager!

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:45.910
I'm telling you not to get any closer 
to my sister than necessary.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:48.430
A battle between two men, eh?

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:49.950
This is getting fun.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:51.250
Give her to me!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.240
<i>Um...</i>

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:16.820
<i>It's as if they're 
fighting over Lady Catarina!</i>

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.240
<i>Ugh, how vexing! I want to fight, too!</i>

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.200
<i>What should we do?</i>

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.840
H-Huh?!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.840
It's Master Nicol!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:33.540
This has gone beyond what I imagined.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.490
Lady Sophia, what shall we do?

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:36.730
Lady Sophia...

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.030
<i>What do I do?!</i>

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:46.480
<i>If evil roles are all I can play,</i>

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.680
<i>then I need to make Maria 
look good as the heroine!</i>

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:01.180
Black Mask is actually working with me.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:04.210
He's a ruse I planted 
to distract the prince.

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:08.550
Now I've attracted more attention 
than that girl or anyone else!

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:11.240
The prince's heart is as good as mine!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.100
Lady Catarina, you saved the day!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:27.430
Everything turned out great 
thanks to you, <i>but still...</i>

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:31.610
Perhaps we were a bit overzealous.

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:32.640
Sorry.

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:35.210
It made the play exciting, so it's fine!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:38.380
Okay, everyone, 
it's time for the last scene!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.070
I'm counting on all of you!

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:47.210
Ah, my princess for a night...

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.120
I want to make the owner 
of this boot my queen.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.040
Marianne!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.720
You are the one I've been searching for!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.350
I love you.

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:04.880
And I love you, my prince!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.920
Lady Katarina...

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:12.970
I must admit that I have always loved you.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:15.080
Oh, my goodness!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.200
Whew... It's finally over.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:37.490
Lady Catarina, thank you so much!

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:40.560
Your portrayal of cruelty 
to the heroine was fantastic!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:44.220
Thanks to you, this has been 
the best school festival in history!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.300
The memories will last forever.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.180
That was a lot of fun, Lady Catarina.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.680
Perhaps you also have talent as an actress?

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.040
An actress?

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.710
Please, don't flatter me like that!

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:56.800
Lady Catarina!

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.780
Saint Catarina!

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:59.360
Please shake my hand!

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:00.160
Huh? Me?

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.000
Thank you.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.120
Lady Catarina.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:07.740
Anne! And Mother and Father, 
you're here, too?

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.580
You were both wonderful.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:13.330
Ah, I'm so proud of my son and daughter!

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:18.290
An actress, huh?

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:21.880
Lady Catarina, the ball is about to start.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.430
Are you ready?

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.300
Oh... Coming!

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:29.530
Everyone else has already left.

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:32.030
Allow me to walk you there.

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:33.120
Thanks.

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:39.870
<i>Whew, I'm hungry.</i>

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:44.350
<i>I'm sure they won't have yakisoba 
or okonomiyaki at a ball,</i>

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:47.570
<i>but I hope they have lots 
of other tasty things.</i>

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:55.460
What's wrong? Are we... lost...

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:01.290
<i>What's going... on?</i>

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:48.550
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:55.390
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:03.770
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:10.740
<b>Secret Catarina</b>
